sequenceDiagram
  actor U as PSE staff member
  participant A as Next.js on Vercel
  participant S as Feature service
  participant D as Supabase PostgreSQL (RLS)
  U->>A: Add a company and its contact person
  A->>S: create contact
  S->>D: insert as the caller
  D-->>S: saved (a duplicate email or phone is refused)
  U->>A: Create a deal for the company
  A->>S: create opportunity
  S->>D: insert, and triggers check the party, contact person, stage and category
  U->>A: Schedule a meeting, then log a follow-up activity
  A->>S: create meeting and activity
  S->>D: insert, and linked people must belong to the deal
  U->>A: Review and record a received contribution
  A->>S: record receipt
  S->>D: record_contribution(): open or won deal, own attribution, safe retry
  A->>A: expire report cache tags
  U->>A: Open the dashboard
  A->>S: report for the period
  S->>D: pse_report(): one SQL snapshot, cached 30 s per user and session
  D-->>U: actual against target, pipeline, workload
